WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.000
A forest morning. Butterflies drift over the grass.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Big Buck Bunny wakes up and stretches in the sun.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.500
Three rodent bullies plot nearby.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A flying squirrel dive-bombs the butterflies.

5
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:27.500
The bunny looks up — this will not end quietly.

6
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:33.000
Title card: Big Buck Bunny, a Blender Foundation open movie.
